---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import video, cover_card -%}
{%- set L = ela.listings -%}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">For grades 3&ndash;8 ELA teachers, interventionists &amp; SPED case managers</p>
    <h1><span class="teach">Read it closely.</span><br><span class="track">Track it simply.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Indiana ILEARN ELA practice for grades 3&ndash;8, with original passages and every answer explained. Alongside it, Mapped &amp; Managed: structured-literacy, IEP and MTSS tools that do the busywork for you.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn--coral" href="/indiana-ela/">Indiana ILEARN ELA</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/shop/">Mapped &amp; Managed tools</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/free-tools/">Free resources</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Two lines, one store</p>
    <h2>What ELA Class 3-8 makes</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--2 mt-2">
      <a class="card card--lane" style="--accent:{{ site.lanes.ela.color }}" href="/indiana-ela/">
        <span class="lane-tag">Indiana ILEARN ELA &middot; Grades 3&ndash;8</span>
        <h3>A practice set for every testing window</h3>
        <p>Checkpoints 1, 2 and 3 and the Summative, for every grade from 3 to 8. Every passage and item is original, and the answer key explains every wrong answer. A free screener comes with each checkpoint.</p>
        <span class="card-foot"><strong>Pick your grade &rarr;</strong></span>
      </a>
      <a class="card card--lane" style="--accent:{{ site.colors.sage }}" href="/shop/">
        <span class="lane-tag">Mapped &amp; Managed</span>
        <h3>Intervention, IEP and MTSS tools</h3>
        <p>Word-mapping mats and decodable passages, IEP goal banks and caseload trackers, small-group planners, and MTSS data systems in Excel and Google Sheets.</p>
        <span class="card-foot"><strong>Browse the four lanes &rarr;</strong></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">See inside</p>
    <h2>Twenty seconds each, pages and all</h2>
    <p class="lead">Every listing has a short video showing the actual pages. Press play on any of these to see what the files look like.</p>
    <div class="vids mt-2">
      {{ video(L["g6-bundle"], "Grade 6 Full-Year Bundle", "Indiana ILEARN ELA") }}
      {{ video(L["g4-cp1-screener"], "Grade 4 Checkpoint 1 Screener", "Free") }}
      {%- for p in products %}{% if p.number == 25 %}
      {{ video(p, p.name, "Mapped & Managed") }}
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Indiana ILEARN ELA</p>
    <h2>Pick your grade</h2>
    <div class="grade-grid mt-2">
      {%- for g in ela.grades %}
      <a class="grade-tile" href="/indiana-ela/grade-{{ g.grade }}/"><span class="n">{{ g.grade }}</span><span class="l">Grade {{ g.grade }}</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start free</p>
    <h2>Try something before you buy anything</h2>
    <p class="lead">A free tool from each Mapped &amp; Managed lane, and a free screener for every Indiana ILEARN ELA checkpoint.</p>
    <div class="grid grid--3 mt-2">
      {%- for f in products %}{% if f.free %}
      {{ cover_card("/resources/" + f.slug + "/", f.cover, f.color, f.laneLabel + " · Free", f.name, f.subhead, "Get it free →") }}
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
      {{ cover_card("/free-tools/#ela", L["g5-cp1-screener"].cover, site.lanes.ela.color, "Indiana ILEARN ELA · Free", "Free checkpoint screeners", "One for every grade and checkpoint, plus a file for each grade band.", "See all the screeners →") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="callout" style="--accent:{{ site.colors.gold }}">
      <h3>Made by someone who's done the job</h3>
      <p>ELA Class 3-8 is built by a 25-year educator with dual master's degrees in Educational Technology and Educational Administration. Every tool is something that had to exist for a real classroom or caseload first. <a href="/about/">Read the story &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
